---
title: Implemented landing and pose publication
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Character
    participant R as Room
    participant A as Animator
    participant W as WASM buffers
    participant B as Generated renderer
    participant V as Canvas
    Note over C,B: A continuing contact maintains grounded state.<br/>Artwork does not add a second jump trajectory.
    C->>C: Resolve landing edge
    C-->>R: MotionFrame
    R->>A: advance with motion and timing
    A-->>R: Land pose and frame
    R->>R: Deliver new Landed event
    R-->>W: Publish completed tick
    B->>W: Read FGS1 and 32-byte FGP1
    W-->>B: Matching world and pose
    B->>B: Validate view identity
    B->>V: Draw selected frame
